boot, `banner logo320 0 0` -- and the bundled sample pictures `alf.pic` and
`alfgs.pic` are images of **ALF**, the title character of the American
television sitcom *ALF* (NBC, 1986-1990):

  Character:   ALF, "Alien Life Form" -- real name Gordon Shumway, of the
               planet Melmac
  Created by:  Tom Patchett and Paul Fusco; ALF was performed by Paul Fusco
  Produced by: Alien Productions
  Rights:      ALF and the character's likeness belong to their rights holders.
               This project is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by
               them, and claims no rights in the character.

All three are stored in GordonOS's own formats -- a custom-glyph banner, and two
160x200 multicolour conversions of a photograph of the character, one in colour
and one in the palette's greys -- and are included as sample content only: a
boot banner, and the pictures `grview` and `grpaint` open to show what the
picture format carries.

